## Test Plan

### Unit Tests
- Test JSON Schema validation with valid/invalid records
- Test deterministic ID generation
- Test BigQuery row formatting

### Integration Tests
- Test end-to-end flow with sample files
- Test quarantine bucket movement
- Test Pub/Sub notification publishing

### Manual Tests
- Upload valid JSON file → verify BigQuery insertion
- Upload invalid JSON file → verify quarantine movement
- Upload mixed file → verify partial processing

```bash
# Deploy and test
gcloud functions deploy validate-events --runtime nodejs14 --trigger-bucket events-input

# Test with valid file
echo '[{"id":"1","timestamp":"2023-01-01T00:00:00Z","event_type":"click"}]' > valid.json
gsutil cp valid.json gs://events-input/

# Test with invalid file
echo '[{"id":"1","event_type":"click"}]' > invalid.json
gsutil cp invalid.json gs://events-input/
```

